<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-15T11:18:21.495Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:18:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits have intensified attacks in Zamfara, killing worshippers in a mosque during Subhi prayer, abducting women and children, and clashing with vigilantes, resulting in dozens of deaths and the rescue of 19 hostages after 22 days. President Tinubu publicly sought forgiveness from victims of the Plateau attack and pledged reconstruction support, while also urging unity. The military reported the rescue of 119 abducted travellers and the killing of terrorists in a single week. AI-generated disinformation is now influencing the upcoming election, adding an information-war element to the conflict. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPQlR2dHlKVUFFZ0oyWHNFMmNuaVVJMHRNTHIwaXZKTk1CVkJ6empqSVoxVkc2TjJPTFYxZk9PR0UzbVZZeDRKV2FocWFqaFRUa01RVDc1TFR2N3R2T3lXbVBWWmVPQTByc05SZS1NS2dJd2Z3cDBDZmYtVHBWUTIyRzVRRnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPZ1pCZDA3ZGQzWVA3VFcwV2N4aGFsY2EwckVpLXh2U01ITm1pYTN4UnJrclVCeDdNbFBvWWUtOVo4Ym9hTGRBc0tEcnlTQ3Y4NXdERW1QYTlMdjJzR2tRYjBlNzRZSzFWcG9CaTctUFktcjYtVExLVnoxNVBBMi1ORjJaOGFCV1lWVV9IenhBX1V6dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNeWpmVmdNUmpOekhvaWhsUEc2bnZLNlh1alQzUXFNaUZXVms3NV9TXzZmQlpWYl9oaW1JQVpMRmdJR2R1REpDamduMklHZE5NUW5VTzRsbVNyMGFrTFdhd0VBSXFFaHFvaFpRRi1xU1UzZ1dPb1d3S2E4UXJhTE5VeG03QVdkWUxjeno3ZkVPSV9uc2lqdXpUbXZYSjJBOU1PZ2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article